------------------------------------------------------------------------
Determining authorship
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Authorship is recorded per commit rather than asserted in the aggregate.
Every commit in this repository is GPG-signed and carries an
OpenTimestamps proof anchored to the Bitcoin blockchain. Commits
containing AI-generated work carry a Co-Authored-By trailer naming the
model responsible, and design documents name their authors directly.

The question "which parts of this repository were written by an AI, and
which one" is therefore answerable from the record:

    git log --format='%H %an %s' --grep='Co-Authored-By'

